# Root build context is used by apps/api/Dockerfile (it needs the Go
# workspace + packages/sdk/gen/go). Keep everything heavy/irrelevant out
# so the context upload stays small.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/.next
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/dist
**/build
apps/dashboard
apps/worker
apps/eval-runner
infrastructure
Project-Documentation
docs
scripts
*.md
data
tmp
*.log
